Warnings only: slug references to a filed proposal, in depends and in a
test tag, and a draft slug starting with a digit. A stale design/STATUS.md
isn't read as a proposal or warned about, since only main regenerates it.
The baseline (id 0) has no issue, so its slug isn't flagged,
and a filed proposal's slug may start with a digit.

warning: design/gfx.md:7: `devsrv` is #12 now
warning: tests/integration.zig:1: tag `devsrv` is #12 now
warning: design/9p-websocket.md: slug `9p-websocket` starts with a digit, so the draft sorts among the filed proposals; start it with a letter

